  Q2. the QUERY arm's gates in order (parse -> lookup -> uid -> policy -> execute)
  Q3. CAT_EXEC on both halves: verb 6/statuses, encoder, and catalog exec
  Q4. the EXEC arm's gates in order, with commit checked before CAT_OK
